  "question": {
    "text": "If three normals are drawn from the point&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> to the parabola&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> and two of which are perpendicular, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is equal to"
