  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of the normal in slope form is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> which passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>"
  }
